  "_about": [
    "One weekly-hours rule (v1.81): the person picker's 'Over weekly limit' (src/lib/weeklyHours.ts),",
    "the swap assistant's hours card and cover search (backend/swaps/worktime.py, matching.py) and the",
    "planner's gate (backend/validation.py validate_weekly_hours) must count the same minutes per ISO week",
    "and use the same limit, contract + tolerance (5 h when unset). Read by",
    "src/lib/weeklyHours.crossCheck.test.ts and backend/tests/test_weekly_hours_crosscheck.py.",
    "Cases: Uma's clinic slot has no times (08:00-16:00); Nils' nights count on their start date",
    "(Sun 6 Dec in W49, Sun 13 Dec in W50); Paul's Vacation-row and Rest Day entries count nothing;",
    "Tara has no tolerance (5 h); Nora has no contract (no limit); Fiona ends exactly at her limit;",
    "Hanna's Thursday shift is hidden by her vacation and counts; Yara's 2026-W53 runs from",
    "Mon 28 Dec 2026 to Sun 3 Jan 2027. Covers: Fri 11 Dec (open) and Sat 2 Jan, open because",
    "Victor, who holds it, is on vacation. Quarter hours: with the Friday cover, Rita's Early shift",
    "(07:45-16:00) makes her week 32.25 h, and Quinn's 19.25 h contract (+ 5 h) makes his limit 24.25 h;",
    "both sides print them as 32.3 and 24.3 (an exact half rounds up). 'shown' holds the hours that both",
    "texts print for each person over the limit."
